  "description": "Four Tops Second Album is\nthe second studio album by American R&B vocal quartet the Four Tops. The album, released on the Motown record label, reached No. 3 on Billboard's Black Albums chart and No. 20 on the Billboard Top LPs chart. The album contains three hit singles. \"I Can't Help Myself \" reached No. 1 on both the Black Singles and Pop Singles charts, while \"It's the Same Old Song\" reached No. 2 and No. 5 respectively, and \"Something About You\" reached No. 9 and No. 19. In 1990, Motown bundled the Four Tops' first two albums together in a release titled Four Tops/Four Tops Second Album.",
